00:04:23.588 --> 00:04:26.121
So diversifying just for
the sake of diversifying

00:04:26.121 --> 00:04:28.413
is not a fantastic strategy.

00:04:28.413 --> 00:04:30.634
What happens, when you're an entrepreneur,

00:04:30.634 --> 00:04:32.194
