00:04:34.837 --> 00:04:37.111
I need to get out of only
having this one company.

00:04:37.111 --> 00:04:38.556
Okay, so you start a second company,

00:04:38.556 --> 00:04:40.065
and you invest in these other businesses,

00:04:40.065 --> 00:04:42.417
and you're trying to run all
these things at the same time.

00:04:42.417 --> 00:04:44.170
What happens is you lose focus.

00:04:44.170 --> 00:04:45.948
And as entrepreneurs in general,

00:04:45.948 --> 00:04:47.749
